Dependencies and data
R and Rcpp, and optional R packages, are installed separately under their
respective licenses. No MATLAB runtime, SAM weights or image datasets are
included. The Boost.Polygon Voronoi experiment uses separately installed
Boost/BH headers and remains tools-only, outside the R package.

Unresolved permissions
The MATLAB snapshot has no root license at the pinned commit. 82 retained
files (including 77 .m files) have no explicit license grant identified by
this audit. This includes much of the core and some third-party helpers.
Public availability, an article's open-access status, attribution, and this
package's GPL declaration do not supply the missing permissions.
Before public redistribution of those files or code derived from them,
obtain an applicable grant or complete a documented replacement/lineage
review. This audit is not blanket legal clearance for the R port.
All 159 retained reference files remain unchanged and excluded from the
package. Repository details: vendor/LICENSING.md, vendor/SOURCES.json and
docs/evidence/attribution/vendor-license-inventory.csv.
